#}
<section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
  <span class="eyebrow">In the room</span>
  <h2>From the conference hall to the orchard</h2>
  <p class="training-intro">Talks, round tables and conversations in the field, in person and online.</p>

  {% set gallerySizes = "(min-width: 1100px) 360px, (min-width: 700px) 45vw, 100vw" %}
  <div class="training-gallery">
    {{ photo(photos.discussion, sizes=gallerySizes) }}
    {{ photo(photos.bridgeAiCompetition, sizes=gallerySizes) }}
    {{ photo(photos.orchard, sizes=gallerySizes) }}
    {{ photo(photos.reflecting, sizes=gallerySizes) }}
    {{ photo(photos.conferenceTalk, sizes=gallerySizes) }}
    {{ photo(photos.conferenceConversation, sizes=gallerySizes) }}
    {{ photo(photos.landscape2024, sizes=gallerySizes) }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="soul-section training-outcomes">
  <div class="training-split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">What your team walks away with</span>
      <h2>Real skills, not just slides</h2>
      <p>After the training, participants can:</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="training-checks">
      <li>Explain in plain words how AI works and where it fits in agriculture and agrifood</li>
      <li>Spot realistic AI opportunities in their own role and business</li>
      <li>Ask the right questions of AI vendors, consultants and data partners</li>
      <li>Use AI assistants safely and productively in everyday work</li>
      <li>Collect and organise data that is ready for future AI projects</li>
      <li>Understand the risks: data privacy, bias, errors and over-reliance</li>
      <li>Take part confidently in AI pilots, grant projects and digital transformation plans</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <span class="eyebrow">Start before we meet</span>
  <h2>Free for everyone on your team, today</h2>
  <p class="training-intro">
    Courses your people can take on their own, at their own pace, before or
    after the training. Both are on aiinagriculture.org.
  </p>

  <div class="training-start">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="eyebrow">AI awareness · Free · Open now</span>
      <h3>{{ facts.course.title }}</h3>
      <p>
        {{ facts.course.lessons }} video lessons ({{ facts.course.duration }}),
        {{ facts.course.quizzes }} marked quizzes, and a certificate of completion
        anyone can verify. No technical background needed.
      </p>
      <p class="training-source">
        {{ facts.reach.students }} students and a {{ facts.course.rating }} rating from
        {{ facts.course.ratings }} ratings on the course's Udemy listing — it is
        moving to aiinagriculture.org from there.
      </p>
      <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ facts.links.course }}">Start the free course ↗</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <span class="eyebrow">AI fluency · In preparation</span>
      <h3>AI Fluency in Agriculture</h3>
      <p>
        A practical course series on briefing AI well, starting with Prompt
        Engineering Basics: no code, no jargon, with tomatoes, trial plots and
        farm shops as the examples all the way through.
      </p>
      <p><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ facts.links.fluencyCourse }}">Join the waiting list ↗</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#
  Law and statistics, each with its source named and linked. Checked on
  training.reviewed; re-check them at every review, because the Act has
  already been amended once since Article 4 first applied.
#}
<section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
  <div class="training-split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">The law</span>
      <h2>Support your EU AI Act AI-literacy duty</h2>
      <p class="pointer-box">{{ training.act.answer }}</p>
      <p>
        The Act does not name a course, and the European Commission's guidance
        says there is no need for a certificate: an internal record of training
        is enough. Training is one measure an organisation can take; on its
        own, it does not make an organisation compliant. National market
        surveillance authorities supervise Article 4 from 2 August 2026.
      </p>
      <p class="training-source">
        Sources:
        <a class="inline-link" href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/oj" rel="noopener">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, the AI Act</a>, Articles 2 and 4;
        <a class="inline-link" href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2026/1744/oj" rel="noopener">Regulation (EU) 2026/1744, the Digital Omnibus on AI</a>, in force from 27 July 2026;
        European Commission,
        <a class="inline-link" href="https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/faqs/ai-literacy-questions-answers" rel="noopener">AI literacy: questions and answers</a>,
        updated 27 July 2026. This is a summary, not legal advice.
        Last reviewed <time datetime="{{ training.reviewed }}">{{ training.reviewed | readableDate }}</time>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">In the UK</span>
      <h3 class="training-figures__title">Where UK workers are starting from</h3>
      <ul class="training-figures">
        {% for figure in training.figures %}
        <li class="stat">
          <strong>{{ figure.value }}</strong>
          <p>{{ figure.text }}</p>
          <p class="training-source"><a class="inline-link" href="{{ figure.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ figure.source }}</a></p>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
  <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span>
  <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    {% for item in training.faq %}
    <details class="card faq-item training-faq">
      <summary><h3>{{ item.question }}</h3></summary>
      <p>{{ item.answer }}{% if item.link %} <a class="inline-link" href="{{ item.link.url }}">{{ item.link.text }}</a> ↗{% endif %}</p>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cta" style="background: var(--accent); color: white; border-radius: var(--radius); text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
  <h2 style="color: white;">Ready to build your team's AI skills?</h2>
  <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">
    Tell me about your organisation and what you would like your team to learn,
    and I'll send a tailored proposal for a lecture, a workshop or a custom
    programme. Online and on-site delivery across the UK and internationally.
  </p>
  <a class="btn" style="background: white; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 20px;" href="{{ enquiry }}">Contact Maryna</a>
  <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 16px;">I reply {{ facts.replyTime }}.</p>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
  {{ photo(photos.aiCamp, sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px", credit=true) }}
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Service",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}#training",
      "name": {{ title | dump | safe }},
      "serviceType": "Corporate AI training",
      "description": {{ description | dump | safe }},
      "url": "{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}",
      "provider": { "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#person" },
      "areaServed": "Worldwide",
      "audience": { "@type": "BusinessAudience", "audienceType": "Agriculture and agrifood organisations" },
      "hasOfferCatalog": {
        "@type": "OfferCatalog",
        "name": "Training formats",
        "itemListElement": [{% for format in training.formats %}
          { "@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": { "@type": "Service", "name": {{ format.name | dump | safe }}, "description": {{ (format.length + ". " + format.bestFor) | dump | safe }} } }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTermSet",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}#levels",
      "name": "Levels of AI capability",
      "hasDefinedTerm": [{% for level in training.levels %}
        { "@type": "DefinedTerm", "name": {{ level.name | dump | safe }}, "description": {{ level.meaning | dump | safe }} }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}#faq",
      "about": { "@id": "{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}#training" },
      "mainEntity": [{% for item in training.faq %}
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": {{ item.question | dump | safe }},
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ (item.answer + (' <a href="' + item.link.url + '">' + item.link.text + '</a>' if item.link else '')) | dump | safe }} }
        }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>
